go 1.27.4

// The core and the contract of plugins (port, a module of its own with its
// own tags port/vX.Y.Z) are developed together: the core's tests run on the
// contract of the same commit. go.mod of the core requires a released
// version of the contract; Go reads the go.mod of every requirement, even
// of a module in use, hence the replace of the required version.
use (
	.
	./port
)

replace github.com/tycheg/reasonr-engine/port v0.1.0 => ./port
